msgstr "啟用"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:42
msgid "Enable this payment provider for checkout"
msgstr "啟用此付款方式以供結帳使用"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:46
msgid ""
"When enabled, customers will be able to use this payment method during "
"checkout."
msgstr "啟用後，客戶將可以在結帳時使用此付款方式。"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:56
msgid "Set as default payment provider"
msgstr "設定為預設付款方式"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:60
msgid ""
"The default provider will be pre-selected during checkout. You can only have"
" one default provider."
msgstr "預設的付款方式將在結帳時預先選中。您只能設定一個預設的付款方式。"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:67
msgid "Display Order"
msgstr "顯示順序"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:72
msgid "Sort Order"
msgstr "排序順序"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:82
msgid ""
"Lower numbers appear first in the checkout payment method list. Use this to "
"control the order of payment options."
msgstr "數字較小的付款方式會在結帳付款方式清單中排在前面。請使用此功能來控制付款選項的順序。"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:90
