#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:183
msgid "Important"
msgstr "重要"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:184
msgid ""
"Webhooks allow your store to receive instant notifications when payments are"
" completed, refunded, or encounter issues. Configure this in your payment "
"provider's dashboard to ensure smooth operation."
msgstr "Webhook 可讓您的商店在付款完成、退款或遇到問題時接收即時通知。請在付款服務商的儀表板中進行設定，以確保順利運作。"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:199
