msgstr "已複製！"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:209
msgid "Failed to copy to clipboard. Please copy manually."
msgstr "複製到剪貼簿失敗。請手動複製。"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:210
msgid ""
"Setting this as the default will remove the default status from any other "
"payment provider. Continue?"
msgstr "將此設定為預設會從其他付款方式中移除預設狀態。確定要繼續嗎？"

#: templates/admin/payment_providers/wizard/step5_configure.html:211
msgid ""
"Cannot set as default while inactive. Please enable the provider first."
msgstr "在未啟用狀態下無法設定為預設。請先啟用此付款方式。"

